From: Paul Moses <p@1g4.org>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: require an explicit gvdb dependency

Remove the unconditional gvdb subproject invocation. Keep the required
dependency lookup so the private diagnostic build can select an explicitly
built copylib archive through pkg-config, without a subproject or fallback.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -2293,8 +2293,6 @@
   use_pcre2_static_flag = false
 endif
 
-# Import the gvdb sources as a subproject to avoid having the copylib in-tree
-subproject('gvdb', default_options: {'tests': false})
 gvdb_dep = dependency('gvdb')
 
 libm = cc.find_library('m', required : false)
